<h1 data-copy-en="Melanthe" data-copy-zh="Melanthe">Melanthe</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Melanthe’s recruitment rolls, assigned cell, relationship actions and corridor encounters." data-copy-zh="Melanthe的招募概率、分配牢房、关系动作与走廊事件。">Melanthe’s recruitment rolls, assigned cell, relationship actions and corridor encounters.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Melanthe</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Eight_Monster_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Monster_Care"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Five_Shared_Corridor_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Personal_Animations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Battle_Preparation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruiting_Melanthe"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Melanthe — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/melanthe.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Melanthe — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/melanthe.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Melanthe — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Melanthe is recruited through the ordinary dungeon, then lives in an available cell in the brothel’s Cell Corridor. Her ordinary relationship and the separate monster-care and training progression should be developed together.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Schedule.2C_Talk_and_Energy_Drain"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Schedule,_Talk_and_Energy_Drain"></span><h2>Where to find Melanthe</h2><p>Prepare a built, unoccupied cell numbered 2–8; cell 1 is reserved. Defeat Melanthe on floors 24–32. The first five victories against this enemy do not roll recruitment. The sixth begins at 20% plus your base Taming stat; each later victory adds another 10 percentage points, up to 100%. Infinity Dungeon battles do not advance this recruitment.</p><p>A repeatable hidden-wall encounter is available on floor 27 while the Cell Corridor is built and she has not been recruited. Counting the top-left tile as column 1, row 1, look at column 3, row 11. On a successful recruitment offer, accept while a free cell is ready. Her assigned cell can vary between saves.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">assigned cell in the Cell Corridor</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">all day</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Accepting recruitment gives 10 direct relationship points, enough for Acknowledged and her cell portrait. Use Talk there, then unlock the higher-stage actions below. Shared corridor encounters require the other listed residents to have been recruited, as well as their individual relationship stages.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">What Still Grows</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Cell Corridor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Daphne Friend (100); Melanthe Friend (100); recruit Daphne / Melanthe</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Daphne +5 / Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shinies of a Fallen Empire</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Cell Corridor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Bobo Friend (100); Melanthe Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Bobo +5 / Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Contest of Contempt</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Cell Corridor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Myriss Friend (100); Melanthe Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Myriss +5 / Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Serpents Choose</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Cell Corridor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Jelly Friend (100); Melanthe Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Jelly +5 / Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Empires and Dinner</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Cell Corridor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Melanthe Friend (100); Bessie Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Melanthe +5 / Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unfinished Pattern</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Cell Corridor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Arachne Friend (100); Melanthe Friend (100); recruit Arachne / Melanthe</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Arachne +5 / Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Ordinary Afternoon</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Cell Corridor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Daphne Close Friend (200); Melanthe Friend (100); after What Still Grows; recruit Daphne / Melanthe</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Daphne +5 / Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Properly Improper</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Cell Corridor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Daphne Friend (100); Melanthe Friend (100); Arachne Friend (100); after What Still Grows / Leave Room for Roots; recruit Daphne / Melanthe / Arachne</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Daphne +5 / Melanthe +5 / Arachne +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Audience Required</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Cell Corridor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Daphne Intimate (1600); Melanthe Romantic (800); Bessie Romantic (800); after What Still Grows / Strong Enough to Rest / A Delicate Negotiation; recruit Daphne / Melanthe / Bessie</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Daphne +5 / Melanthe +5 / Bessie +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk costs 15 minutes and gives 1 base point, with three safe uses daily. Use the cell’s separate care and training controls for monster progression; Tamed is a separate value from relationship affection.</p><p>The personal animations listed below are optional and use their own stage, Energy and content-access requirements. They do not replace the corridor scenes.</p><p>Energy Drain is a one-time skill lesson at Friend (100), Mystic 24: 220 minutes, $500, 70 Energy and 50 Calm. It requires the corresponding content access and disappears once learned.</p><p>In monster management, she starts at 20 Tamed. Feed uses 7 Food for Tamed +10. Teach and Training require at least 30 Tamed, so feeding first is especially useful below that threshold. Each care session has separate Feed, Discipline, Teach and Training allowances; finish the categories you want before leaving, because successful care spends the daily visit. Resting blocks a new visit.</p><p>Tamed begins losing 7 points per game day after the first care visit. Ordinary relationship points do not prevent that decay. Training unlocks eight levels, advancing one level per completed session while retaining earlier choices. Monster stats cap at 100; the last two training options each raise two different random stats. Monster experience pays for further stat increases at a cost equal to the new stat value. One Smelling Salts reduces Stress by 10 for every active monster.</p><p>Listed relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers can change the final gain. Daily allowances for the same action follow the character across locations; starting it elsewhere does not create a fresh allowance.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Charm 80 / Intelligence 80 / Taming 75</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Ritual Mastery</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Melanthe</th><td data-label="Location / start window">assigned cell in the Cell Corridor; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Energy Drain</th><td data-label="Location / start window">assigned cell in the Cell Corridor; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); Mystic 24; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">220 min; $500; −70 Energy; −50 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Energy Drain; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ancient Rites</th><td data-label="Location / start window">assigned cell in the Cell Corridor; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −100 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +10; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Coiled Rite</th><td data-label="Location / start window">assigned cell in the Cell Corridor; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −100 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +25; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Priestess Above</th><td data-label="Location / start window">assigned cell in the Cell Corridor; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −100 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +40; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>No-cell encounters do not assign a resident. Build an additional free cell before trying again. Visit the assigned cell rather than assuming the same room number used in another player’s save. Changing floors does not replace the required enemy-specific victories.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Brothel operations</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">Construction and Forge</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Eight_Monster_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Monster_Care"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Five_Shared_Corridor_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Personal_Animations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Battle_Preparation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruiting_Melanthe"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Melanthe 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/melanthe.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Melanthe 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/melanthe.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Melanthe 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Melanthe通过普通地下城招募，之后住进青楼牢房走廊中分配给她的牢房。普通关系与独立的魔物照料、训练进展需要分别培养。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Schedule.2C_Talk_and_Energy_Drain"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Schedule,_Talk_and_Energy_Drain"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>先准备一间已建成、尚未占用的2—8号牢房；1号牢房另有保留。击败第24—32层的Melanthe。前5次胜利不会进行招募判定，第6次从20%加玩家基础驯服属性开始，以后每多一次胜利再增加10个百分点，最高100%。无限地下城战斗不累计这项招募进展。</p><p>牢房走廊已建成、尚未招募她时，第27层有可重复的隐藏墙壁战斗。以上左角为第1列、第1行计算，位置是第3列、第11行。成功出现招募机会时，须有空牢房才能接纳；她被分配到的牢房会因存档而异。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">牢房走廊内当前分配的牢房</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">全天</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>接受招募会直接增加10点关系，达到已遇见并开放牢房头像。可以先在那里交谈，再解锁下表中的高阶段动作。走廊共同事件除了各自的关系阶段，还要求所列的其他住户已经招募。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">仍在生长的事物</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">牢房走廊; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Daphne 朋友（100）；Melanthe 朋友（100）；已招募Daphne、Melanthe</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Daphne +5、Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">陨落帝国的亮亮</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">牢房走廊; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Bobo 朋友（100）；Melanthe 朋友（100）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Bobo +5、Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">轻蔑之争</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">牢房走廊; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Myriss 朋友（100）；Melanthe 朋友（100）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Myriss +5、Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">灵蛇的选择</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">牢房走廊; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Jelly 朋友（100）；Melanthe 朋友（100）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Jelly +5、Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">帝国与晚餐</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">牢房走廊; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Melanthe 朋友（100）；Bessie 朋友（100）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Melanthe +5、Bessie +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未完的纹样</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">牢房走廊; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Arachne 朋友（100）；Melanthe 朋友（100）；已招募Arachne、Melanthe</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Arachne +5、Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一个平常的下午</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">牢房走廊; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Daphne 亲密朋友（200）；Melanthe 朋友（100）；完成：仍在生长的事物；已招募Daphne、Melanthe</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Daphne +5、Melanthe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不合规矩的好规矩</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">牢房走廊; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Daphne 朋友（100）；Melanthe 朋友（100）；Arachne 朋友（100）；完成：仍在生长的事物、给树根留点空间；已招募Daphne、Melanthe、Arachne</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Daphne +5、Melanthe +5、Arachne +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不需要观众</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">牢房走廊; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Daphne 亲密（1600）；Melanthe 浪漫感（800）；Bessie 浪漫感（800）；完成：仍在生长的事物、坚强，也可以休息、一场温柔的协商；已招募Daphne、Melanthe、Bessie</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Daphne +5、Melanthe +5、Bessie +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈消耗15分钟、获得1点基础关系，每日安全额度3次。魔物进展请使用牢房中独立的照料与训练控制；驯服度和普通关系好感是不同数值。</p><p>下表中的个人动画为可选活动，各自检查关系阶段、精力与内容访问权限，也不能代替走廊共同事件。</p><p>能量汲取是一次性技能教学，要求朋友（100）、神秘24，消耗220分钟、500财富、70精力和50镇定。需要相应内容访问权限，学会后不再提供。</p><p>在魔物管理中，她初始有20点驯服度。喂食消耗7份食物，增加10点驯服度；教导与训练都要求至少30点，因此低于门槛时可以先喂食。每次照料中，喂食、管教、教导与训练各有独立额度；成功照料后会花掉当天拜访额度，离开前请做完想进行的类别。休息状态不能开启新拜访。</p><p>第一次照料后，驯服度每个游戏日减少7点，普通关系好感不会阻止这项衰减。训练共开放8级，每次完成升一级，并保留之前的选项。魔物属性上限100，最后两项训练各随机增加两种不同属性。还可花费魔物经验升级属性，消耗等于升级后的新数值。一份嗅盐能使所有已启用魔物的压力各减少10点。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，所列关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量会受共通关系修正影响。同一动作的每日额度跟随角色计算，换地点不会获得新额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">魅力 80、智力 80、驯服 75</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">仪式精通</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Melanthe 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">牢房走廊内当前分配的牢房; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">能量汲取</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">牢房走廊内当前分配的牢房; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；神秘24；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">220分钟；财富500；−70 精力；−50 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会能量汲取；1次／日安全额度；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">古老仪式</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">牢房走廊内当前分配的牢房; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−100 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+10；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">盘卷之仪</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">牢房走廊内当前分配的牢房; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−100 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+25；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">女祭司在上</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">牢房走廊内当前分配的牢房; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−100 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+40；1次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>没有空牢房时发生的事件不会分配住户，请先建好另一间空牢房再尝试。拜访时应寻找自己存档中分配的房间，不能照搬其他玩家的牢房编号。换楼层也不能代替对指定敌人的胜利次数。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">青楼经营</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密互动</a> · <a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">建造与锻造</a></p></section>
